claim.claim-text:
a substrate (1), comprising a first surface (11) and a second surface (12) opposite to each other in a thickness direction of the substrate;
a first passivation layer (21), disposed on the first surface (11) of the substrate (1);
a second passivation layer (22), disposed on a side of the first passivation layer (21) away from the substrate (1);
wherein a material of the first passivation layer (21) is the same as that of the second passivation layer (22); an atomic packing density of the first passivation layer (21) is higher than that of the second passivation layer (22); and an average thickness of the first passivation layer (21) is smaller than that of the second passivation layer (22).
